      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MYDEEPESTDESIRE (4) has the hoof on the till after placing in all three starts to date. Drew wider than this and raced three deep without cover but fought well for a close second last week at Maryborough, beaten a nose. Gets her lowest draw so far. That gives her the chance to break through. PET WOLF (3) made a solid return to the track at his latest appearance at this circuit and distance, finishing 1.3 metres from the winner in second after being close to the pace throughout. Should enjoy an economical run from this draw. Yet to miss a place and with added fitness could take this out. MYSTIC MOTIVER (9) is another that looks close to a win and must be considered after she finished runner-up in both outings off a spell. EVA EXPRESS (2) was beaten only 2m on debut. Open to natural improvement and should not have any excuses from the favourable draw.",
